<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank data show net reserves steady on week.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank data show net reserves steady on week.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank data released on Monday show that net currency reserves were steady at about 102 billion marks in the week ending July 7, unchanged from the level in the week ending June 30.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following reserve data: (in billion marks)</p>
<p> Banking week ended		    July 7	  June 30</p>
<p> Gross currency reserves	     117.9	   117.9</p>
<p> Foreign liabilities		   15.9	    15.9</p>
</text>
